      "type": "info",
      "text": "**AND** is TRUE only when every test is TRUE: `=AND(test1,test2)`. OR needs either test TRUE: `=OR(test1,test2)`. XOR is TRUE when exactly one test is TRUE: `=XOR(test1,test2)`."
